    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia na Abarekabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yehoyakimu, mosinto o Yosia, arenge omorwoti bw’Abayuda, ring’ana rigacha ase Yeremia korwa ase Omonene, rikamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Genda ase abanto b’eamate ya Rekabu, okwane nabarabwo, obarente ase eero eyemo y’enyomba y’Omonene, obae edivai banywe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio inche nkaira Yasania, omwana o Yeremia, mosinto o Habasinia, amo nabamura bamwabo, na abana baye bonsi, na abanto bonsi b’eamate y’Abarekabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabarenta ase enyomba y’Omonene ase eero y’abana ba Hanani, mosinto o Igidalia, omonto o Nyasae. Eero eyio nigo yarenge ang’e neria y’abanene b’obogambi eyarenge irongo y’eria ya Maaseya mosinto o Salumu, omorendi bw’egesieri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngatereka bosio bw’abaanto b’eamate ya Rekabu ebitoono biaichire edivai, nkabaa nebikombe, nkabateebia, “Kanywe edivai eyio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende barabwo bakairaneria, bakaboora, “Intwe titokonywa edivai, ekiagera Yonadabu, mosinto o Rekabu, sokoro yaito, natokanetie ng’a titobaisa konywa edivai nonya ng’ake, intwe gose chinderia chiaito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo naende agatokania, agatoteebia ng’a titobaisa koagacha chinyomba gose kobusura chimbusuro, gose gosimeka, gose gotwara emegondo y’emesabibu, korende ng’a tomenye ase chiema ase amatuko aito onsi, erio nario toragenderere koba moyo ase ense eye intwe tore abamenyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio intwe na abakungu baito, na abana baito, abamura na abaiseke, twabeire toigwerete Yonadabu, mosinto o Rekabu, sokoro yaito, ase amang’ana onsi atochigeete ng’a titobaisa konywa edivai ase amatuko aito onsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intwe titoagacheti chinyomba chi’okomenya, gose titobwati emegondo y’emesabibu, gose ey’okobusura, gose chimbusuro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intwe twabeire tokoigwera na kogenderera komenya ase chiema. Twakorire amang’ana onsi aya Yonadabu, sokoro yaito, atochigeete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekero Nebukadinesaro, omorwoti o Babiloni, achete korwania ense eye, tokairoka abarwani b’esegi b’Abakalidayo na aba b’Abasiiria erio togatebania; Inchuo, togende Yerusalemu. Bono Yerusalemu tomenyete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha ase Yeremia, rikamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Genda okwane n’Abayuda na abanto ba Yerusalemu, obaborie: Inee! Timori gwancha amorokererio na koigwera amang’ana aane inche Omonene?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana aria Yonadabu, mosinto o Rekabu, achigete abana baye ng’a tibaabaisa konywa edivai, nigo aigwereire na korendwa goika rituko ria reero. Onde tari bw’ororeria roria okonywa edivai, ekiagera baigwerete ogochika gwa sokoro yabo. Inche nabeire ngokwana nainwe kogenderera botambe, korende mwangire konyigwera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabeire ngendererete gotoma abasomba baane ababani ase more kobateebia: Kera oyomo oino aonchoke, atige chinchera chiaye chimbe, na ogokora kwaye okobe, gose timobaisa korigia chinyasae ching’ao na gochikorera. Komorakore igo, mogenderere komenya ase ense eyio naete chisokoro chiaino. Korende timwategererete moigwe amang’ana aane, gose timwanyigwerete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto b’ororeria rwa Yonadabu, mosinto o Rekabu, babeire baigwerete na korenda ogochika baetwe na sokoro yabo, korende abanto aba bangire konyigwera inche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aya nar’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Emeganda, oyore Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Naama! Inche nkorenta nde amabe onsi nakwanete achiche igoro y’Abayuda na abanto bonsi ba Yerusalemu, ekiagera nabeire ngokwana nabarabwo, korende barabwo bangire koigwera; nabeire nkobarangeria, korende bangire goitaba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Yeremia agakwana nabaanto b’eamate y’Abarekabu, agateeba, “Aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Mwaigwereire amang’ana aria Yonadabu, sokoro yaino, abachigete, na mwarendire emeroberio yaye yonsi, na gokora amang’ana onsi abachigete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Omonto takobora korwa ase ororeria rwa Yonadabu, mosinto o Rekabu, oratenene ase obosio bwane kare na kare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
